        <mxCell id="nStaticJwt" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;align=left;spacing=8;" value="SECURITY (OLD)&#xa;• Static JWT hardcoded in docker-compose.yaml (SOVD_ACCESS_TOKEN env var)&#xa;• Same long-lived shared secret for every request to the CDA&#xa;• No workload identity, no authorization policy&#xa;• All services start with a single &#39;docker compose up&#39; (no profiles)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="390" x="990" y="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nSteps" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;spacing=10;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;MESSAGE FLOW&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d79b00&quot;&gt;OTA FIRMWARE UPDATE&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A1  Operator → symphony-api : POST /users/auth (REST) → JWT&lt;br&gt;A2  Operator → symphony-api : POST /targets/registry/ecu-updater-target (Bearer, body=target.json)&lt;br&gt;A3  symphony-api → mosquitto : MQTT publish topic &#39;coa-request&#39; (desired state)&lt;br&gt;A4  mosquitto → symphony-agent : MQTT deliver &#39;coa-request&#39;&lt;br&gt;A5  symphony-agent → mosquitto : MQTT publish &#39;coa-response&#39; (ack)&lt;br&gt;A6  mosquitto → symphony-api : MQTT deliver &#39;coa-response&#39;&lt;br&gt;A7  symphony-agent → ecu-updater : uProtocol RPC GET up://ecu-updater/1A100/1/1 (poll ~15s)&lt;br&gt;A8  symphony-agent → ecu-updater : uProtocol RPC UPDATE .../1/2 (install FW) · DELETE .../1/3 (remove FW)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;POWERTRAIN MODE CONFIG CHANGE&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;B1  fms → mosquitto : uProtocol RPC setCurrentMode(Economy|Performance) over MQTT5&lt;br&gt;B2  mosquitto → powertrain-mode-controller : deliver RPC request&lt;br&gt;B3  controller → sovd-cda : HTTP PUT .../data/powertrain_mode (Bearer = &lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;static hardcoded JWT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;)&lt;br&gt;B4  sovd-cda → ecu-sim : UDS WriteDataByIdentifier  2E 4E 66   over DoIP (ISO 13400)&lt;br&gt;B5  ecu-sim → sovd-cda : UDS positive response  6E 4E 66&lt;br&gt;B6  sovd-cda → controller : HTTP 200 OK&lt;br&gt;B7  controller → mosquitto : uProtocol RPC response over MQTT5&lt;br&gt;B8  mosquitto → fms : deliver RPC response (mode confirmed)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#82b366&quot;&gt;VEHICLE SIGNALS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;C1  vehicle-properties ↔ databroker : gRPC Kuksa VAL v1 (:55555) get/set VSS&lt;br&gt;C2  vehicle-properties ↔ mosquitto : uProtocol pub/sub (MQTT5) signal updates&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#999999&quot;&gt;M   dozzle → Docker Engine : stream logs   ·   portal → api : REST poll (UI)&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="410" width="580" x="340" y="710" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
