        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nPtc2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d4e1f5;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" value="powertrain-mode-controller (CHANGED)&#xa;validates JWT-SVID (aud: powertrain-mode-control)&#xa;+ OPA authz.rego (regorus)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="240" x="70" y="640" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nCda2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d4e1f5;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" value="sovd-cda (REBUILT: opensovd-cda)&#xa;custom build + spiffe_security_plugin&#xa;validates JWT-SVID (aud: sovd.cda) + OPA authz.rego&#xa;SOVD/HTTP :20002" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="240" x="70" y="790" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nEcusim2" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" value="ecu-sim&#xa;Simulated ECU (blueprint-ecu)&#xa;DoIP + Control HTTP :8181" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="210" x="70" y="950" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nSteps2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;spacing=10;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;MESSAGE FLOW (CHANGES vs OLD IN PURPLE)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;SPIFFE IDENTITY (ALL NEW)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;S1  spire-agents → spire-server : node attestation via x509 certs, TLS :8081&lt;br&gt;S2  operator runs register_workloads.sh : registers fms, ptc, vehicle-properties, cda (Docker selectors)&lt;br&gt;S3  workloads → their spire-agent : SPIFFE Workload API over UNIX socket (shared volume)&lt;br&gt;S4  fms fetches JWT-SVID (aud: powertrain-mode-control) · ptc fetches JWT-SVID (aud: sovd.cda)&lt;br&gt;S5  ptc + cda validate incoming JWT-SVIDs via Workload API, then evaluate OPA authz.rego (regorus)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d79b00&quot;&gt;OTA FIRMWARE UPDATE (unchanged flow; profile fw-update)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A1–A8  same as OLD · ecu-updater bumped to 0.1.1, UP_LOCAL_ADDRESS addressing&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;POWERTRAIN MODE CONFIG CHANGE (profile: powertrain)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;B0  &lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;vehicle-properties → fms : publishes SupportedModes; fms cycles only reported modes&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;B1  fms → mosquitto : uProtocol RPC setCurrentMode + &lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;JWT-SVID (aud: powertrain-mode-control)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;B2  mosquitto → ptc : deliver RPC request → &lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;ptc validates JWT + OPA policy check&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;B3  ptc → sovd-cda : HTTP PUT .../data/powertrain_mode · Bearer = &lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;fresh JWT-SVID (aud: sovd.cda)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;B3a &lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;cda validates JWT via spiffe_security_plugin + OPA authz.rego&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;B4  sovd-cda → ecu-sim : UDS WriteDataByIdentifier  2E 4E 66   over DoIP&lt;br&gt;B5  ecu-sim → sovd-cda : UDS positive response  6E 4E 66&lt;br&gt;B6–B8  responses back to fms (unchanged)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#82b366&quot;&gt;VEHICLE SIGNALS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;C1  vehicle-properties ↔ databroker : gRPC Kuksa VAL (:55555) · &lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;+ SupportedModes in VSS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;C2  vehicle-properties ↔ mosquitto : uProtocol pub/sub (MQTT5)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="380" width="540" x="350" y="700" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
