        <mxCell id="nIssue7Note3" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;fontSize=11;align=left;spacing=8;" value="ISSUE 7 — CDA ACCESS HARDENING&#xa;• CDA has no TCP port: SOVD only via Unix socket&#xa;• Volume cda-sovd-socket: sovd-cda (rw), ptc (ro) only&#xa;• /run/cda 0750 · cda.sock 0770 · owner 10001:10100&#xa;• ptc removed from vehicle-sovd network&#xa;• CDA + ptc non-root, cap_drop ALL, no-new-privileges&#xa;• CDA pinned to hackathon fork 58f0c90 → ECU lock required for writes&#xa;• Known limitation: lock endpoints not covered by OPA (TC17)" vertex="1">
