        <mxCell id="nSteps3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;spacing=10;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;MESSAGE FLOW (ISSUE 7 CHANGES IN TEAL)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;SPIFFE IDENTITY (unchanged)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;S1  spire-agents → spire-server : node attestation (x509, TLS :8081)&lt;br&gt;S2  register_workloads.sh : fms, ptc, vehicle-properties (Docker selectors)&lt;br&gt;S3/S4  workloads ↔ spire-agent : Workload API (UNIX socket) · fetch JWT-SVIDs&lt;br&gt;S5  ptc + cda validate JWT-SVIDs, then evaluate OPA authz.rego&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d79b00&quot;&gt;OTA FIRMWARE UPDATE (unchanged, profile fw-update)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A1–A8  operator → symphony-api → mosquitto → symphony-agent → ecu-updater&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;POWERTRAIN MODE CONFIG CHANGE (profile powertrain)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;B0  vehicle-properties → fms : SupportedModes&lt;br&gt;B1/B2  fms → mosquitto → ptc : setCurrentMode + JWT-SVID → JWT + OPA check&lt;br&gt;B3  &lt;font color=&quot;#0e8088&quot;&gt;ptc → sovd-cda via /run/cda/cda.sock (no TCP), Bearer JWT-SVID (aud sovd.cda):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;font color=&quot;#0e8088&quot;&gt;① POST …/blueprint-ecu/locks (10 s)  ② PUT …/data/powertrain_mode  ③ DELETE …/locks/{id}&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;B3a  &lt;font color=&quot;#0e8088&quot;&gt;kernel: group 10100 + mode 0770 on connect()&lt;/font&gt; · cda: JWT + &lt;font color=&quot;#0e8088&quot;&gt;lock held&lt;/font&gt; + OPA authz.rego&lt;br&gt;B4/B5  sovd-cda → ecu-sim : UDS 2E 4E 66 / 6E 4E 66 over DoIP (vehicle-sovd)&lt;br&gt;B6–B8  responses back to fms&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#82b366&quot;&gt;VEHICLE SIGNALS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;C1  vehicle-properties ↔ databroker : gRPC Kuksa VAL (:55555)&lt;br&gt;C2  vehicle-properties ↔ mosquitto : uProtocol pub/sub (MQTT5)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="390" width="520" x="370" y="725" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
